      {
        "id": 12877,
        "quiz_id": 2170,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "In many countries nowadays, consumers can go to a supermarket and buy food produced all over the world.  Do you think this is a positive or negative development?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L1qmdTvyyoyIS0xkAQWlMdvWgdA\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em><strong>In many countries nowadays, consumers can go to a supermarket and buy food produced all over the world. </strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LgyjdnOd8ofVXXxJFvPlcIg6gxc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em><strong>Do you think this is a positive or negative development?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Global Food in Supermarkets</em></p>\n<em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\">Xem livestream giải đề n&agrave;y c&ugrave;ng thầy Phạm Minh Khoa (<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>2 lần 9.0</strong></span>)<a href=\"https://youtu.be/SBOuGdgW-rA?si=SRkjcTfGArFZIAM6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">tại đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute;!</span></a></span></em>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1. Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LGDQdWiIvohAS0xObhKlh062gjf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MQicdfv64oPhyYx6X92ltPwLgve\">\n<ul>\n<li>Đề b&agrave;i Global Food in Supermarkets&nbsp;n&oacute;i về việc người ti&ecirc;u d&ugrave;ng c&oacute; thể mua thực phẩm được sản xuất từ khắp nơi tr&ecirc;n thế giới tại c&aacute;c si&ecirc;u thị địa phương, v&agrave; hỏi liệu đ&acirc;y l&agrave; xu hướng t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực.</li>\n<li>Global Food in Supermarkets&nbsp;l&agrave; một chủ đề li&ecirc;n quan đến to&agrave;n cầu h&oacute;a (<strong>globalization</strong>) v&agrave; thương mại quốc tế (<strong>international trade</strong>). Xu hướng n&agrave;y đ&atilde; trở n&ecirc;n phổ biến trong v&agrave;i thập kỷ gần đ&acirc;y, mang lại cả lợi &iacute;ch v&agrave; th&aacute;ch thức cho người ti&ecirc;u d&ugrave;ng, nền kinh tế v&agrave; m&ocirc;i trường.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CaaPdALkUoj39UxqBaClSdzHg7g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2. Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn c&oacute; thể lựa chọn quan điểm l&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang t&iacute;nh t&iacute;ch cực hoặc ti&ecirc;u cực. Ở đ&acirc;y, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm trung lập, tức l&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y c&oacute; cả mặt t&iacute;ch cực v&agrave; ti&ecirc;u cực.</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lập luận theo c&aacute;ch Partly Agree.</strong></li>\n<li>Để bảo vệ quan điểm trung lập n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng ta sẽ b&agrave;n luận về cả mặt t&iacute;ch cực v&agrave; ti&ecirc;u cực của xu hướng:\n<ul>\n<li>BODY 1: Những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực</li>\n<li>BODY 2: Những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6Q8dKUwJolsRLxRHMKlYAGzgPb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 1</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ARYZdTorMo8GHUxXiaxlbgKog9K\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3WzdXi90obr9exqY49ldT5Wg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3vid37FgouPrLxntpAllbSOgpd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ABpydqwzqoBt8mxtA2clX4h8gmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FRtld534aoXQ8Cxcdevl45SsgZc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtESdRTjnoSJwzxYBWkl2MvDgXb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UaoQdMKTxottsFx5xHZl5y6dgTe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ShyKdSzwIoav15xhSR1lkgYvgiN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZEmd8SBoo63w3xc6eeljjfXgad\">M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực của việc c&oacute; thể mua thực phẩm từ khắp nơi tr&ecirc;n thế giới.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YDTVddNyTo6lkPxbj5pl10HNgHh\">Cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản l&agrave;: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J2Mgd651jokGr5xFFcTlMHOagYg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YIkYdyyfZoikZgxMfM9ly4SYghh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mk2zdFhmloeQGbxZgDwlEsvwgnh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JesqdVbvXoysYjxqtf7lyoDSg7c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-S0GAd5xJ8oGcMrxuRAElpmNagXe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-OsCQdHBlGorApzxfalrlFo4EgCu\">Xu hướng thực phẩm nhập khẩu c&oacute; sẵn ở si&ecirc;u thị địa phương mang lại lợi &iacute;ch cho người ti&ecirc;u d&ugrave;ng (<strong>consumers</strong>) v&agrave; sự ph&aacute;t triển kinh tế tổng thể (<strong>overall economic development</strong>).&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZSGudTTeHoUUbwxmgwvlnevNg0d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Br0HdPtt2o6yaDxssU5lFwBbgic\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXHedb5Q5o0ChTxzjeJlACIHgBe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qw7XdcQDiopHAmxbaJzlaWDZgjb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EAA1dQKV5otLAmxFGgBlpln2gIe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N5dHdBAjeojWA3xMEbCl8pn1gyB\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">Đối với người ti&ecirc;u d&ugrave;ng:</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">&nbsp; ➜ c&oacute; nhiều lựa chọn đa dạng hơn về thực phẩm (<strong>wider variety of choices</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">&nbsp; ➜ tiếp cận được những sản phẩm trước đ&acirc;y kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; (<strong>previously unavailable</strong>) ở địa phương (<strong>region</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">&nbsp; ➜ l&agrave;m phong ph&uacute; trải nghiệm ẩm thực (<strong>enrich culinary experiences</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">&nbsp; ➜ kh&aacute;m ph&aacute; hương vị v&agrave; nguy&ecirc;n liệu mới từ khắp nơi tr&ecirc;n thế giới m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng cần đ&iacute;ch th&acirc;n đến những nơi đ&oacute; (<strong>physically traveling abroad</strong>)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJW5dfJhqofjuXxEd7dlCvwzg3b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LQSEdv0Y1oIVaoxMMoxljdOvgOd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HNQNdCbCpoystuxVP43luHtDgeb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HJ7FdScShoqf2QxHEgylSbaAgyf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NFfDdmOXNoOWwZxiNtZl15SMgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0zKdQFrWoIXtex6mhplQSoegxb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GSzZdCMyEoNpLYxJV9Cl8D96gih\">Đối với nền kinh tế:</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GSzZdCMyEoNpLYxJV9Cl8D96gih\">&nbsp; ➜ ng&agrave;nh n&ocirc;ng nghiệp to&agrave;n cầu (<strong>global agribusiness</strong>) trở th&agrave;nh nguồn đ&oacute;ng g&oacute;p kinh tế quan trọng (<strong>significant economic contributor</strong>) cho nhiều quốc gia</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GSzZdCMyEoNpLYxJV9Cl8D96gih\">&nbsp; ➜ tạo việc l&agrave;m trong chuỗi cung ứng (<strong>supply chain</strong>) từ n&ocirc;ng nghiệp, chế biến thực phẩm đến hậu cần (<strong>logistics</strong>) v&agrave; b&aacute;n lẻ (<strong>retail</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GSzZdCMyEoNpLYxJV9Cl8D96gih\">&nbsp; ➜ c&aacute;c nước c&oacute; thể b&aacute;n n&ocirc;ng sản địa phương (<strong>local</strong> <strong>produce</strong>) ra to&agrave;n cầu</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GSzZdCMyEoNpLYxJV9Cl8D96gih\">&nbsp; ➜ ch&iacute;nh phủ c&aacute;c nước nhập khẩu c&oacute; thể tăng thu nhập quốc gia bằng c&aacute;ch đ&aacute;nh thuế (<strong>imposing tariffs</strong>) l&ecirc;n h&agrave;ng h&oacute;a nhập khẩu (<strong>foreign</strong> <strong>trade goods</strong>).</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GSzZdCMyEoNpLYxJV9Cl8D96gih\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 2</strong> </span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FkKtdjQLbo1AtlxkzyalC6VXgEc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZT8dluWuoiebixsy4zlDBdDg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ub8odKVWsohu3TxKHTylRfJ3gqT\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IO0OdZMbkop2KtxaAgbl07P0g3f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ap4ndJ97bocXozxn7oAl3Txmgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwiNdcUNSoCW0UxEnPxlYn1NgYe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lsjlde9EKo9cSdxAvmulNTZPgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RZnadsyhdo5qQ6xErIQlFWRvgSj\">M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về những th&aacute;ch thức m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể g&acirc;y ra cho m&ocirc;i trường v&agrave; an ninh lương thực quốc gia (<strong>national food security</strong>).</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwhEdYaGpoEt0uxx9Y3lwW7eg7d\">Cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản l&agrave;: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZakddQ7nJoAgFyxpFvNleucyg4d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBDmdoEGDoDyBgxNOqylocGigdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PoBydy7ixoRrKIxO5gdlnQbzg7e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FPwwd6a20oL0khxlV17lQP1fgSh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-CLHQd8Vyjoq587xOQKBlr5EDg4b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SbBndOTuXo5EfuxYDTEl8jx6gwd\">Việc dễ d&agrave;ng thưởng thức m&oacute;n ăn tr&ecirc;n thế giới c&oacute; thể g&acirc;y ra nhiều th&aacute;ch thức cho m&ocirc;i trường (<strong>environment</strong>) v&agrave; an ninh lương thực quốc gia (<strong>national food security</strong>).</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOMmd2z40oU1GpxeAiOljjORg6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IP8udCf4UodaQ1xp6r1lvwiTgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FWGcdCLrAodR0zx9hxultvvcg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JcusdZSFzovztExclQWl7chLg4e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9rFdK1ipoSiH8x8Lc1lqPoUgYf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZa1dU6WtoYm51x9m3JlC8V6gQe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G35adIotboSlwYxl0TulS1RkgJh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GxjAdTMZ4oLFMxxVV2Ql6oA7gNg\">Đối với m&ocirc;i trường:</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GxjAdTMZ4oLFMxxVV2Ql6oA7gNg\">&nbsp; ➜ vận chuyển thực phẩm quốc tế (<strong>international produce</strong>) qua đường h&agrave;ng kh&ocirc;ng hoặc đường biển (<strong>seafaring vessels</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GxjAdTMZ4oLFMxxVV2Ql6oA7gNg\">&nbsp; ➜ thải ra kh&iacute; nh&agrave; k&iacute;nh (<strong>greenhouse gas emissions</strong>)&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GxjAdTMZ4oLFMxxVV2Ql6oA7gNg\">&nbsp; ➜ tạo ra lượng kh&iacute; thải carbon đ&aacute;ng kể (<strong>considerable carbon footprint</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GxjAdTMZ4oLFMxxVV2Ql6oA7gNg\">&nbsp; ➜ l&agrave;m trầm trọng th&ecirc;m t&igrave;nh trạng biến đổi kh&iacute; hậu (<strong>exacerbating climate change</strong>).</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZnEdzqc4oEV4wxO5mZluCDFgQd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXimdSddLo8wilxpbXMli5xmgBf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXfQd5foZotNYvxR3yulUfOegnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JKs3d2HFfoJfLcxOlhZlsYPPgOc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVGzda09ioegiAxjp4BlwN6Ugee\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dc96dxi8Do6jiRxbpzIlbykXgw1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G5ZpdUrBGo32f9xVwUnleCm6gtf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Đối với an ninh lương thực:</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G5ZpdUrBGo32f9xVwUnleCm6gtf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ phụ thuộc qu&aacute; nhiều v&agrave;o nguồn cung b&ecirc;n ngo&agrave;i (<strong>external sources</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G5ZpdUrBGo32f9xVwUnleCm6gtf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ l&agrave;m suy yếu c&aacute;c nh&agrave; cung cấp trong nước (<strong>domestic suppliers</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G5ZpdUrBGo32f9xVwUnleCm6gtf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ một số quốc gia trở n&ecirc;n phụ thuộc v&agrave;o nguồn cung thực phẩm nước ngo&agrave;i (<strong>foreign food supplies</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G5ZpdUrBGo32f9xVwUnleCm6gtf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ chuỗi cung ứng (<strong>supply chains</strong>) dễ bị ảnh hưởng bởi thi&ecirc;n tai (<strong>natural disasters</strong>)&nbsp;hoặc bất ổn ch&iacute;nh trị (<strong>political instability</strong>)&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G5ZpdUrBGo32f9xVwUnleCm6gtf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ v&iacute; dụ: Cuộc chiến Nga-Ukraine g&acirc;y gi&aacute;n đoạn cho xuất khẩu l&uacute;a m&igrave; (<strong>wheat exports</strong>) của Ukraine</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G5ZpdUrBGo32f9xVwUnleCm6gtf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ g&acirc;y tăng gi&aacute; (<strong>price hikes</strong>) v&agrave; thiếu hụt nguồn cung (<strong>supply shortage</strong>) cho nhiều quốc gia&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 89,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RC0GdIGPToxomhx4iEIlL991gZg\">These days, it is increasingly common for consumers in many countries to purchase food produced in various regions of the world at local supermarkets.<strong> In my opinion, this trend has both positive and negative impacts, depending on different aspects.</strong></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12877,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 90,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DWZLdGba7oCobpx99k2lWFGcgsh\"><strong>On the one hand, the prevalence of food originating from other countries can be beneficial to consumers and overall economic development. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">For individuals, it provides a wider variety of choices in groceries, allowing them to access options that were previously unavailable in their region. This increased access to a diverse range of produce can enrich their culinary experiences by enabling them to explore new flavors and ingredients from around the world without physically traveling abroad. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Furthermore, global agribusiness has become a significant economic contributor for many nations, primarily through job creation and tariff revenues. In other words, it generates employment opportunities throughout the supply chain, from farming and food processing to logistics and retail, allowing countries to sell their local produce globally, while the governments at the place of import can increase their national incomes by imposing tariffs on foreign trade goods.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12877,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 91,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2 ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CrjkdeBRbos9I4xNpBBlthp7gLh\"><strong>On the other hand, the greater availability of food produced in other parts of the world may pose various challenges to the environment and national food security. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Regarding the former, transporting international produce over long distances by airplanes or seafaring vessels contributes to greenhouse gas emissions, thereby generating a considerable carbon footprint and exacerbating climate change. <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">I</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">n addition to weakening domestic suppliers, heavy reliance on external sources can make some countries dependent on foreign food supplies and thus more vulnerable to natural disasters or political instability affecting supply chains. For example, the ongoing war between Ukraine and Russia has severely disrupted wheat exports from the former, causing price hikes and supply shortages for many nations, leading many to question the benefits of globalization.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12877,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 92,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jc4TdmqY0o0MBZx0Q1jlpQi3gDg\">In conclusion, the question of whether the trend of buying imported food is positive or negative has no one-size-fits-all answer. It offers significant advantages in terms of consumer choices and economic growth, but also presents environmental and food security challenges.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12877,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
